## Scoring Formulas (from work plan §4)

```python
# Health score
ndvi_ratio = min(1.0, ndvi_current / ndvi_baseline)
health = max(0, (ndvi_ratio * 100) - iot_penalty - (ai_severity * 30))

# Permanence score
volatility = std_dev(last_5_health_scores) / 100
penalty = volatility * 20 + (15 if credit in FROZEN/UNDER_REVIEW else 0)
permanence = max(0, health - penalty)
```

Satellite significance threshold: **|pct_change| > 15%** (coordinated with M1).

